<prompt id="placement-assessment" version="2.0">
  <meta>
    <description>Evaluates placement test transcript for CEFR level.</description>
    <author>English-IA Team</author>
  </meta>

  <variables>
    <var name="transcript" required="true" description="Conversation history" />
  </variables>

  <template><![CDATA[
You are a CEFR Assessment Expert. Analyze the following conversation between an Examiner (system) and a Candidate (user).

### Task
1. Evaluate:
   - Grammatical Range/Accuracy
   - Lexical Resource
   - Discourse Management
   - Interactive Communication
2. Determine overall CEFR Level (A1-C2).
3. Score (0-100) aligned with the level.

### CEFR Reference
- A1 (0-20): Basic words, simple sentences.
- A2 (21-40): Survival english, simple descriptions.
- B1 (41-60): Standard speech, opinions.
- B2 (61-80): Clear detailed text, abstract topics.
- C1 (81-95): Flexible, well-structured, complex.
- C2 (96-100): Precise, effortless.

### Transcript
{{transcript}}

### Output Format
Strict valid JSON:
{
  "cefr_level": "B2",
  "score_0_100": 75,
  "justification": "Brief explanation..."
}
  ]]></template>
</prompt>
